<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1585) <span class="when">Oct 14, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Each clip, then its shot.</b> In the conform report the shot&#8217;s name follows the camera clip&#8217;s, in every list and on each clip&#8217;s sheet. Names come from the shots folder when Pull Plates hasn&#8217;t planned the cut.</li>
<li><b>Proxy offline.</b> A clip whose cut file is missing but whose camera original is found says so, instead of Offline: plates pull from the original.</li>
<li><b>Line Up by Picture</b> no longer looks unavailable.</li>
<li><b>Use Camera Originals.</b> When a cut&#8217;s proxies are offline and their camera originals are found, the Conform window&#8217;s Media line can point those clips at the camera files; camera raw among them is then offered to develop.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
